OL,3,GNEWSASpace team's joy as craft nears   
OL,4,AMercury                                
OL,6,FMore than 20 years after first working 
OL,7,Fon a mission to Mercury as a student in
OL,8,FLeicester, Dr Adrian Martindale has    
OL,9,Ffinally seen the instrument he helped  
OL,10,Fdevelop reach the planet.              
OL,12,FThe moment came after an eight-year    
OL,13,Fjourney through space, which ended when
OL,14,Fthe BepiColombo spacecraft entered     
OL,15,Forbit around Mercury on Saturday.      
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
