OL,3,GNEWSASpace team's joy as craft nears   
OL,4,AMercury                                
OL,6,FScientists at the University of        
OL,7,FLeicester are now preparing to receive 
OL,8,Fthe first scientific data from the     
OL,9,Fmission, using the Mercury Imaging     
OL,10,FX-ray Spectrometer (MIX), an instrument
OL,11,Fdesigned and developed by an           
OL,12,Finternational team led by the          
OL,13,Funiversity.                            
OL,15,FResearchers hope it will help answer   
OL,16,Flong-standing questions about how      
OL,17,FMercury formed and evolved.            
